  "title": "Nourishing Middle Eastern Lamb Kebabs",
  "description": "A quick-fix Middle Eastern dish featuring lamb kebabs with a mustardy and molten flavor, made with red wine vinegar and pickle, following ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly principles.",
