  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together red wine vinegar, pickle juice, Dijon mustard, olive oil, garlic, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the lamb cubes to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the marinated lamb cubes onto skewers, leaving a small space between each cube.",
    "Grill the kebabs for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until the lamb is cooked through.",
    "Let the kebabs rest for 2 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve the kebabs hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley or cilantro if desired."
